NAO ascensions by year:

+------+---------------+
| 2004 |           412 |
| 2005 |           674 |
| 2006 |          1538 |
| 2007 |          1186 |
+------+---------------+

There's a huge jump in 2006, as you can see, and 2007 is on pace to
break that mark handily.  When you get that kind of jump, something
significant has happened, and it seems very likely that that something
was everything finally coming together for people.

I know that my personal approach to the game prior to November 2005 was
markedly different from my approach to the game now, and my experience
and discussions on NAO are what made it so.

