If your purpose is to ascend at all costs (the tournament tends to bring
this sort of play out even in people who normally don't do that kind of
thing), then you wish for quest artifacts -- and the Eye is paramount
among stuff you can wish for if you get a chance.

I've only played one wizard on NAO, and he was the last ascension in my
string of 13; deliberately left 'til the end because I expected exactly
what I got: 1/1.  I don't play them otherwise because, well, they're
kind of boring except for the ultra-early game what with the guaranteed
Magicbane and all.  :/

