Well, I _could_ assume that everyone who's currently playing remains
static and never learns... which doesn't seem like a very fair
characterization of them to me, since people tend to get better at things.

Or I could assume that if the game is "easy" at some point, and it's
becoming easier and easier to get to the level where the game is "easy",
then potentially the game needs to be a bit more challenging so as to
provide more enjoyment for a greater segment of the population.  Because
once the game gets "easy", it also gets "boring", and that's never good.

